  <li>Deepfake detection and synthetic media analysis</li>
  <li>Multimedia forensics and tamper localization</li>
  <li>Copyright authentication for images, audio, and video</li>
  <li>Adversarial attacks and defenses in watermarking systems</li>
  <li>Blockchain-based copyright management and traceability</li>
  <li>Privacy-preserving copyright verification</li>
  <li>Trusted media distribution architectures</li>
  <li>Neural network watermarking and model ownership protection</li>
  <li>Federated learning for secure multimedia applications</li>
  <li>Detection of AI-generated text and multimedia content</li>
  <li>Secure content sharing in social media platforms</li>
